// A wandering crowd (EntityEffectHandler: footprints, breath, the per-entity effect scan): 48 cows, sheep and pigs
// free to wander in a fenced pen of snow blocks built high over snowy plains, at noon in clear weather. They leave
// prints in the snow and their breath shows in the cold. Against prints off and breath off. Wandering mobs move as
// they like, so runs differ more than a still scene's: compare with --spread. The pen stands north of the biome's
// place ([0, -160]: frost is south, the snowspouts east). See README.md.
{
  "world": "bench",
  "seed": 20261030,
  "setup": [
    "gamemode creative",
    "gamerule advance_time false",
    "gamerule advance_weather false",
    "gamerule spawn_mobs false"
  ],
  "video": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080,
    "vsync": false,
    "maxFps": 260
